It's intentional. You can't #twoweapon with a cursed secondary weapon,
so if the secondary weapon gets cursed _while_ two-weaponing,
two-weaponing stops for consistency; the now-alternate weapon can't
weld, since you're no longer wielding it, so it gets dropped instead.

